$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Compound 5. Compound 10. Compound 10 was
synthesized using the procedure described for the synthesis of 5. Only
the mixture was heated at reflux with vigorous stirring for 0.5 h to give
the uncyclized product as a red solid in yield of 82%. Due to high
activity of the pyridine proton in solution, only MS was recorded. MS
(MALDI-TOF): cacld for M-, 787.3; found, 787.3.
