$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-phenyl-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (6a).
An argon purged mixture of 7-iodotubercidin 7 (200 mg, 0.51 mmol),
phenylboronic acid (93 mg, 0.76 mmol), Na2CO3 (502 mg, 4.74 mmol),
Pd(OAc)2 (6.6 mg, 0.029 mmol), and TPPTS (42 mg, 0.07 mmol) in water/MeCN
(2:1, 3.6 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 1 h. After cooling, the mixture
was neutralized by the addition of aqueous HCl (1M), volatiles were
removed in vacuo and the residue was purified by reverse phase
chromatography (0→100% MeOH in water).
4-Amino-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-5-(thiophen-2-yl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(6g). Compound 6g was prepared as described for 6a from compound 7 and
thiophene-2-boronic acid; yield 82%; white solid after recrystallization
from MeOH. mp 188 °C; [α]20D -74.5 (c 0.235, DMSO). UV (MeOH): λmax (ε)
284 (13300). 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6): 3.54 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 12.0,
J5'b,OH = 6.2, J5',4' = 3.8, H-5'b); 3.63 (ddd, 1H, Jgem = 12.0, J5'a,OH
= 5.0, J5'a,4' = 3.8, H-5'a); 3.91 (td, 1H, J4',5' = 3.8, J4',3' = 2.9,
H-4'); 4.09 (ddd, 1H, J3',2' = 5.0, J3,OH = 4.7, J3',4' = 2.9, H-3');
4.43 (ddd, 1H, J2',OH = 6.4, J2',1' = 6.3, J2',3' = 5.0, H-2'); 5.13 (d,
1H, JOH,3' = 4.7, OH-3'); 5.20 (dd, 1H, JOH,5' = 6.2, 5.0, OH-5'); 5.34
(d, 1H, JOH,2' = 6.4, OH-2'); 6.10 (d, 1H, J1',2' = 6.3, H-1'); 6.32 (bs,
2H, NH2); 7.15 (dd, 1H, J3,4 = 3.5, J3,5 = 1.2, H-3-thienyl); 7.18 (dd,
1H, J4,5 = 5.1, J4,3 = 3.5, H-4-thienyl); 7.57 (dd, 1H, J5,4 = 5.1, J5,3
= 1.2, H-5-thienyl); 7.62 (s, 1H, H-6); 8.15 (s, 1H, H-2). 13C NMR (125.7
MHz, DMSO-d6): 61.79 (CH2-5'); 70.78 (CH-3'); 74.06 (CH-2'); 85.40
(CH-4'); 87.17 (CH-1'); 100.84 (C-4a); 108.65 (C-5); 122.26 (CH-6);
126.06 (CH-5-thienyl); 126.58 (CH-3-thienyl); 128.49 (CH-4-thienyl);
135.72 (C-2-thienyl); 150.82 (C-7a); 152.22 (CH-2); 157.49 (C-4). MS
(FAB): m/z 349 (M+H). HRMS (FAB) for C15H17N4O4S [M+H] calcd: 349.0971;
found: 349.0965. Anal. Calcd for (C15H16N4O4S): C, 51.71; H, 4.63; N,
16.08. Found: C, 51.33; H, 4.48; N, 15.75.
