$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
4-Amino-5-(3,4-dimethylphenyl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine(1t).
An argon-purged mixture of
4-amino-5-iodo-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine (2, 392
mg, 1 mmol), 3,4-dimethylphenylboronic acid (225 mg, 1.5 mmol), Na2CO3
(318 mg, 3 mmol), TPPTS (71 mg, 0.125 mmol), and Pd(OAc)2 (11 mg, 0.05
mmol) in water/MeCN (2:1, 5 mL) was stirred at 100 °C for 3 h. After
cooling, the mixture was neutralized using aqueous HCl (1 M) and
concentrated to dryness in vacuo. The residue was loaded on silica by
co-evaporation from chloroform/MeOH solution, and column chromatography
(SiO2, 0→2.5% MeOH in CHCl3).
4-Amino-5-(benzo[d][1,3]dioxol-5-yl)-7-(β-D-ribofuranosyl)-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidine
(1z). Compound 1z (187 mg, 81%) was prepared as described for 1t from 2
(235 mg, 0.6 mmol) and 3,4-methylenedioxyphenylboronic acid. Beige foam.
Mp 128-133 °C. [α]D -55.6 (c 0.239, DMSO). 1H NMR (499.8 MHz, DMSO-d 6):
3.54 (ddd, 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´b,OH = 6.2, J 5´b,4´ = 3.8, H-5´b); 3.63
(ddd, 1H, J gem = 12.0, J 5´a,OH = 5.0, J 5´a,4´ = 3.8, H-5´a); 3.90 (td,
1H, J 4´,5´ = 3.8, J 4´,3´ = 3.2, H-4´); 4.10 (ddd, 1H, J 3´,2´ = 5.2, J
3´,OH = 4.9, J 3´,4´ = 3.2, H-3´); 4.45 (ddd, 1H, J 2´,OH = 6.4, J 2´,1´
= 6.1, J 2´,3´ = 5.2, H-2´); 5.11 (d, 1H, J OH,3´ = 4.9, OH-3´); 5.18
(dd, 1H, J OH,5´ = 6.2, 5.0, OH-5´); 5.31 (d, 1H, J OH,2´ = 6.4, OH-2´);
6.07 (s, 2H, H-2-benzodioxolyl); 6.10 (d, 1H, J 1´,2´ = 6.1, H-1´); 6.15
(bs, 2H, NH2); 6.91 (dd, 1H, J 6,7 = 7.9, J 6,4 = 1.7,
H-6-benzodioxolyl); 7.00 (d, 1H, J 4,6 = 1.7, H-4-benzodioxolyl); 7.02
(d, 1H, J 7,6 = 7.9, H-7-benzodioxolyl); 7.47 (s, 1H, H-6); 8.13 (s, 1H,
H-2). 13C NMR (125.7 MHz, DMSO-d 6): 61.87 (CH2-5´); 70.81 (CH-3´); 73.97
(CH-2´); 85.26 (CH-4´); 87.22 (CH-1´); 100.75 (C-4a); 101.32
(CH2-2-benzodioxolyl); 108.89 (CH-7-benzodioxolyl); 109.17
(CH-4-benzodioxolyl); 116.25 (C-5); 121.04 (CH-6); 122.00
(CH-6-benzodioxolyl); 128.38 (C-5-benzodioxolyl); 146.63
(C-7a-benzodioxolyl); 147.91 (C-3a-benzodioxolyl); 150.81 (C-7a); 151.82
(CH-2); 157.48 (C-4). IR (ATR): ν 1626, 1591, 1543, 1491, 1469, 1297,
1239, 1210, 1106, 1083, 1035, 933, 796 cm-1. MS (ESI) m/z 387 (M+H), 409
(M+Na). HRMS (ESI) for C18H19N4O6 [M+H] calcd: 387.1299; found: 387.1298.
