$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound P3. A solution of P2 (0.470 g, 0.918 mmol),
bis(pinacolato)diboron (2.296 g, 9.77 mmol), KOAc (2.031 g, 20.7 mmol) in
dioxane (78 mL) was bubbled with nitrogen for 20 minutes. Pd(dppf)Cl2
(0.068 g, 0.093 mmol) was added and the reaction was heated to 85 ºC.
After stirring for 18 hr, the reaction was cooled to room temperature and
partitioned between CH2Cl2 (200 mL) and H2O (200 mL). The aqueous layer
was washed with CH2Cl2 (100 mL), and the combined organic layers were
washed with H2O (2 x 200 mL). The solution was concentrated in vacuo to
give the crude product. Column chromatography with a 90% CH2Cl2/10%
hexanes mobile phase. The pure product (0.416 g, 81%). 1H NMR (500 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 8.87 (dd, J = 8.3, 1.0 Hz, 1H), 8.62-8.55 (m, 2H), 8.47-8.43
(m, 2H), 8.43-8.39 (m, 2H), 8.19 (d, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H), 7.67 (dd, J = 8.4,
7.5 Hz, 1H), 4.21-4.08 (m, 2H), 2.02-1.93 (m, 1H), 1.46 (s, 12H),
1.44-1.24 (m, 8H), 0.95 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 3H), 0.89 (t, J = 7.1 Hz, 3H).13C
NMR (126 MHz, CDCl3): δ 164.54, 138.19, 137.62, 137.13, 136.42, 131.85,
131.80, 131.78,131.62, 129.88, 129.20, 127.87, 127.41, 126.85, 123.68,
122.72, 121.50, 120.94, 120.42, 84.37, 44.32, 38.10, 30.97, 28.92, 25.15,
24.28, 23.26, 14.27, 10.85. HRMS (ESI) m/z calcd for C36H39BNO4 [M + H]+
559.3003; found 559.2998.
